	(text "Power - PROTOTYPE architecture (vault Main-Board-01: 5 V in -> P-FET reverse-polarity -> VM direct; 3.3 V via LDO). Incoming supply rail is an open entry gate in the vault. Net naming: vault VIN_RAW == KiCad VM (same copper). Sensor VIN (encoder FFCs) also runs from VM (LX34311 needs 4-6 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.354 181.864 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "586a4f04-9682-4565-a212-9e5417ca25ad")
	)
	(text "Review 2026-08-22: input path = pads (VIN_PAD) -> polyfuse F60 -> VIN_PROT (TVS D62 to GND) -> Q1 reverse-polarity FET -> VM. VM bulk C61/C62 2x22uF added (TI: sufficient bulk on VM). LDO output cap now tantalum."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.748 189.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7a1ebc2e-eba5-4882-bb9c-b71244724ebc")
